  "releaseNotes": "4.0.0: one client per provider (OpenAiClient, AnthropicClient, ...) with every operation and a checked capability matrix; OpenAiClient on the Responses API and OpenAiCompatibleClient for Chat Completions servers; citations, RawResponse, and AppliedReasoningEffort on every response. Breaking: see MIGRATION_V3_TO_V4.md and CHANGELOG.md at https://github.com/jchristn/PolyPrompt.",
